<title>PHILIPPINES: Centennial City full-year net at 69.9 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Centennial City full-year net at 69.9 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial City Inc, formerly Guoco Land Philippines Inc, reported on Monday its full-year profit reached 69.9 million pesos for the fiscal year ending June 30, 1996. It did not give comparative figures for last year.  </p>
<p>Centennial City listed four billion common shares on October 2 to cover the company's swap agreement with Amari Coastal Bay Development Corp, a firm that has the right to reclaim 750 hectares of land in Manila Bay.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
